{"displayStem":"정제된 DNA 기질 가·나를 만든 뒤 같은 양의 세포 추출물을 처리했다. 그림은 손상 종류의 개념도이며 실제 분자 크기는 반영하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 모식도·합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 모식도\"><defs><marker id=\"c06arr\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L8 3.5L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path></marker><pattern id=\"c06hatch\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 8L8 0\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></pattern></defs><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><text x=\"60\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">가</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\">나</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′ — G — 3′</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′ — T — 5′</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">정상 염기 불일치</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5′ — T—T — 3′</text><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"85\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"94\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"350\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3′ — A—A — 5′</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">UV 후 T–T 결합</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}